      "date": "2026-02-10T05:36:20.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹40.42 (vs ₹27.89 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹40.42 (up from ₹27.89 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.83b (up 27% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.42b (up 11% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 21% (down from 24% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.8% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Pharmaceuticals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 8% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
